Package: structshift
Type: Package
Title: Measures of Structural Shifts and Differences (Gatev, Ryabtsev, Kazinets, Szalai)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kirill", "Astrakhantsev", email = "astrakhantsev.ka@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes summary measures of structural shifts (changes of a
    structure over time) and structural differences (between two structures
    at the same moment): the integral coefficient of structural changes by
    K. Gatev, the index of V. M. Ryabtsev with its interpretation scale,
    linear and quadratic coefficients of L. S. Kazinets, the normalized
    coefficients of Gatev, the index of dissimilarity and the index of
    A. Szalai. Results are printed with a step-by-step calculation table
    in Russian, suitable for teaching statistics and economic analysis.
